  "3835": { "hanzi": "面对突发火灾，切记要保持冷静，不要慌张。", "pinyin": "Miànduì tūfā huǒzāi, qièjì yào bǎochí lěngjìng, bú yào huāngzhāng.", "meaning": "Facing sudden fire, remember to keep calm, don't panic." },
