  "3849": { "hanzi": "广场上建立了一座雄伟的英雄纪念碑。", "pinyin": "Guǎngchǎng shàng jiànlì le yī zuò xióngwěi de yīngxióng jìniànbēi.", "meaning": "A majestic hero monument was built on the square." },
