  "3852": { "hanzi": "假如明天天气晴朗，我们就去郊游。", "pinyin": "Jiǎrú míngtiān tiānqì qínglǎng, wǒmen jiù qù jiāoyóu.", "meaning": "If weather is clear tomorrow, we will go on an outing." },
