  "3909": { "hanzi": "展览展示了中国近代社会的历史变革。", "pinyin": "Zhǎnlǎn zhǎnshì le Zhōngguó jìndài shèhuì de lìshǐ biàngé.", "meaning": "The exhibition displayed historical changes of modern Chinese society." },
